Your tools (OPTIONAL)
Connect an MCP server your team runs and every project in this workspace can use its tools — so a run can reach data you would rather not upload.

The credential you paste is sent to your server by the agent itself, from inside the run's sandbox, and anything it fetches lands in that project. Connect a server whose token is scoped to what you are willing to have a run read — and whatever the agent then writes into the project is stored with the project.

