Slack (OPTIONAL)
Runs post checkpoints, blockers, and questions to this channel, and a reply in the thread resumes the run.

Anyone who can post in this channel — including workspace admins — can reply to a question and steer that run, acting as the person who started it. Choose the channel accordingly.

Create a Slack app in your workspace with the scopes chat:write, channels:history (and groups:history for private channels), install it, then paste its bot token below.

